<body>
<div class="footer">OresamSub Customer Conversion Guide · Internal marketer material · {{ date('Y') }}</div>

<section class="cover">
    <div class="brand">ORESAMSUB</div>
    <h1>Customer<br>Conversion Guide</h1>
    <p>A practical playbook for welcoming new customers, reactivating old customers and explaining why OresamSub deserves another transaction.</p>
    <span class="tag">Reliability · WhatsApp · Support · Rewards</span>
    <div class="cover-foot">Prepared for OresamSub marketers and customer-success representatives.</div>
</section>

<section class="page">
    <div class="head"><h2>The OresamSub value story</h2><p>Lead with customer problems we now solve—not discounts alone.</p></div>
    <table class="grid">
        <tr><td class="card"><h3><span class="number">1</span>Easy modern experience</h3>A cleaner PWA and mobile app make it easier to fund a wallet, find plans, complete purchases, review records and repeat previous transactions.</td><td class="card"><h3><span class="number">2</span>WhatsApp transactions</h3>Customers can access supported data and airtime services, favourite plans, repeat purchases, updates and assistance directly through WhatsApp.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="card"><h3><span class="number">3</span>Highly reliable processing</h3>Improved automation and multiple service routes support dependable delivery, with clear transaction status when a provider experiences downtime.</td><td class="card"><h3><span class="number">4</span>Dedicated human support</h3>Customers have a responsive support team to help investigate delayed, failed or unclear transactions.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="card"><h3><span class="number">5</span>Campaign rewards</h3>Eligible customers can receive welcome, reactivation, targeted and weekly transaction-volume rewards in a visible bonus wallet.</td><td class="card"><h3><span class="number">6</span>Competitive pricing</h3>Multiple pricing levels support personal customers, regular buyers, resellers and higher-volume users.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="card"><h3><span class="number">7</span>One account, many services</h3>Data, airtime, electricity, cable TV and other supported digital services are managed from one account and wallet.</td><td class="card"><h3><span class="number">8</span>Transparent records</h3>Customers can see plan, amount, recipient, date and transaction status—useful for both personal buyers and resellers.</td></tr>
    </table>
    <div class="callout"><b>Best selling order:</b> reliability → WhatsApp convenience → support → easy interface → transparent records → pricing and bonuses.</div>
</section>

<section class="page">
    <div class="head"><h2>Reactivating an old customer</h2><p>Recognise their history, explain what has improved, then make returning effortless.</p></div>
    <div class="script"><strong>Opening:</strong><br>“Hello [Name], this is [Agent] calling from OresamSub. You previously used our platform, and we noticed it has been a while. We have made important improvements and wanted to personally invite you back.”</div>
    <div class="script"><strong>Value:</strong><br>“OresamSub now has a cleaner mobile experience, improved transaction automation, clearer records and dedicated support. You can also complete supported purchases directly through WhatsApp, so you do not always need to open the website or app.”</div>
    <div class="offer"><h3>Welcome back with ₦200</h3><p>Eligible dormant customers receive a ₦200 reactivation bonus when they log in. The reward is credited to their bonus wallet, and they can tap <b>Transfer to Main Wallet</b> to use it for transactions.</p></div>
    <div class="script"><strong>Incentive:</strong><br>“When you log back into your eligible dormant account, you receive ₦200 in your bonus wallet. You can then tap ‘Transfer to Main Wallet’ and use it for your transactions. You may also qualify for other active campaign and weekly transaction rewards.”</div>
    <div class="script"><strong>Close:</strong><br>“I can send your login and WhatsApp access links now and help you regain access. Would you prefer WhatsApp or the mobile app?”</div>
    <h3>What the marketer should do</h3>
    <ul class="checklist"><li>Confirm the customer’s preferred name and channel.</li><li>Confirm that the account is eligible for the dormant-customer campaign before promising the ₦200 reward.</li><li>Ask why they stopped using the service; listen before selling.</li><li>Match their concern to one concrete improvement.</li><li>Offer to guide them through login recovery, locating the bonus wallet and tapping <b>Transfer to Main Wallet</b>.</li><li>Send the correct link immediately and agree on a follow-up time.</li></ul>
</section>

<section class="page">
    <div class="head"><h2>Welcoming a new customer</h2><p>Make the benefit simple, specific and easy to try.</p></div>
    <div class="script"><strong>New-customer pitch:</strong><br>“OresamSub gives you affordable data, airtime, electricity and cable services through one secure account. You can use our mobile app, installable web app or transact through WhatsApp. Transactions are highly reliable, records are transparent, and our support team is available when you need help.”</div>
    <div class="script"><strong>Reseller pitch:</strong><br>“For resellers, OresamSub provides competitive pricing levels, transaction history, favourite and repeat-purchase tools, supported API access and multiple ways to serve customers—including WhatsApp.”</div>
    <div class="offer"><h3>Earn up to ₦500 weekly</h3><p>Complete successful eligible transactions worth ₦20,000 or more within a week and receive an additional bonus based on the active campaign—up to ₦500. Only successful eligible transactions count; campaign terms apply.</p></div>
    <p class="small">Never promise that every customer automatically receives a campaign. Say “eligible customers” and confirm the currently active campaign rules.</p>
    <h3>Short WhatsApp selling lines</h3>
    <ul class="checklist"><li>Buy supported data and airtime without leaving WhatsApp.</li><li>Chat. Purchase. Stay connected.</li><li>Your everyday digital services, now in one WhatsApp conversation.</li><li>Use the app, PWA or WhatsApp—your wallet and records remain together.</li></ul>
</section>

<section class="page">
    <div class="head"><h2>Handling common objections</h2><p>Respond honestly. Never argue or guarantee what providers control.</p></div>
    <div class="objection"><b>“I experienced a failed or delayed transaction before.”</b><br>“I understand. OresamSub has improved automation, provider routing and transaction tracking. Provider downtime can still happen, but our support team can now help you follow the status more clearly.”</div>
    <div class="objection"><b>“Your prices are not the cheapest.”</b><br>“Price matters, but reliability, support and clear records also protect your money and customers. OresamSub offers competitive pricing levels based on how you use the platform.”</div>
    <div class="objection"><b>“I do not want another complicated app.”</b><br>“You can transact through WhatsApp for supported services, use the installable PWA, or use the mobile app—whichever is easiest for you.”</div>
    <div class="objection"><b>“Will I really receive a bonus?”</b><br>“Bonuses depend on the active campaign and your eligibility. When you qualify, the reward appears transparently in your bonus wallet and can be moved to your main wallet.”</div>
    <div class="objection"><b>“What if I need help?”</b><br>“Our dedicated support team is available to investigate transaction and account concerns. I can also show you the fastest support channel.”</div>
    <div class="callout"><b>Never say:</b> <span class="avoid">“Every transaction is guaranteed,” “providers never go down,” or “everyone automatically gets ₦500.”</span></div>
</section>

<section class="page">
    <div class="head"><h2>Call checklist and follow-up</h2><p>A good conversation ends with a clear next action.</p></div>
    <table class="two-col"><tr><td><h3>Before calling</h3><ul class="checklist"><li>Know whether the lead is new, dormant or active.</li><li>Review any known previous concern.</li><li>Know the current campaign terms.</li><li>Have login, registration, app and WhatsApp links ready.</li></ul></td><td><h3>Before ending</h3><ul class="checklist"><li>Confirm the customer’s main need.</li><li>Recommend the best channel.</li><li>Send the promised link while still on the call.</li><li>Ask permission to follow up.</li><li>Record the outcome accurately.</li></ul></td></tr></table>
    <div class="callout"><b>Primary objective:</b> get one safe next action—a login, registration, WhatsApp conversation, wallet funding or first transaction. Do not overwhelm the customer with every feature at once.</div>
    <h3>Suggested follow-up message</h3>
    <div class="script">“Hello [Name], thank you for speaking with me. Here is your OresamSub login link: [LINK]. As an eligible returning customer, logging in credits a ₦200 reactivation reward to your bonus wallet. Tap ‘Transfer to Main Wallet’ to use it for transactions. You can also enjoy supported data, airtime and bill services with improved reliability, clear records and dedicated support. Reply here if you need help getting started.”</div>
</section>
